               <title>Inactive Ingredients</title>
               <text>
                  <paragraph>butylparaben, carboxymethylcellulose sodium, cellulose, citric acid, corn syrup, FD&amp;C red #40, flavor, glycerin, microcrystalline cellulose, propylene glycol, purified water, sodium benzoate, sodium saccharin, sorbitol, sucralose, xanthan gum</paragraph>
               </text>
               <effectiveTime value="20160817"/>
            </section>
         </component>
